---
---
<section class="about" id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="about-inner">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Miami Tech Media</p>
      <div class="accent-line" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <h2 id="about-heading">
        Creative Strategy.<br />
        Thoughtful Production.<br />
        <em>A Partner You Can Trust.</em>
      </h2>

      <div class="about-body">
        <p>
          Miami Tech Media has been part of Miami&rsquo;s tech community
          since 2016. Over the years, we&rsquo;ve worked alongside the
          people and organizations helping the community grow.
        </p>
        <p>
          What started with photography and video naturally became
          something more. Sometimes clients needed help figuring out the
          idea before creating it. Other times, they needed someone they
          trusted to help bring all the pieces together.
        </p>
      </div>

      <blockquote class="trust-statement">
        <strong>A more personal creative partnership.</strong>
        You&rsquo;ll work directly with Jorge, so it&rsquo;s always easy to
        ask questions, talk through ideas, and know who you&rsquo;re
        working with.
      </blockquote>
    </div>

    <div class="about-media">
      <div class="about-media-frame">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/images/jorge-about-portrait.avif" type="image/avif" />
          <source srcset="/images/jorge-about-portrait.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img
            src="/images/jorge-about-portrait.webp"
            alt="Jorge, founder and creative director of Miami Tech Media, in a modern workspace overlooking the Miami skyline."
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    background: var(--white);
    padding: 6rem 0 6rem;
  }

  .about-inner {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 3rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  /* ── COPY ── */
  .about-copy {
    position: relative;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-size: var(--type-eyebrow-size);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--type-eyebrow-tracking);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }

  .accent-line {
    width: 32px;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--blue);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 3.4vw, 2.9rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--rich);
    line-height: 1.14;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 0 0 1.75rem;
  }

  h2 em {
    color: var(--blue);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .about-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .about-body p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: 1.72;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 46ch;
  }

  .trust-statement {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--blue);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .trust-statement strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--rich);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  /* ── MEDIA ──
     New portrait asset (jorge-about-portrait) is a native 1:1 square
     (1254x1254). Frame ratio matches it exactly so object-fit: cover
     crops nothing — the full approved composition (skyline, plant,
     laptop, mug, camera, lamp) stays visible, and the taller square
     shape gives the portrait much more vertical presence than the
     previous wide image, balancing against the copy column. */
  .about-media {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .about-media-frame {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-media-frame picture {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .about-media-frame img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center center;
  }

  /* ── RESPONSIVE ── */
  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .about {
      padding: 4rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .about-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2.75rem;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-body p {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }
</style>
